/*
 * lxa_images.c - Intuition's built-in BOOPSI image classes (Phase 223):
 * imageclass, sysiclass and frameiclass, plus the drawing helpers the
 * window chrome, the screen bar and GadTools share with them.
 *
 * Appearance is taken from real AmigaOS 3.1 (reference-driven development):
 *  - sysiclass images are table driven (lxa_sysi_data.h, generated by
 *    tools/rdd/sysitable.py from the rendering gallery reference);
 *  - frameiclass frames follow the edge rules observed in the frame gallery
 *    (tests/scenarios/gallery-frames.yaml).
 */

